This document outlines the end-to-end Agile Sprint Plan for building and delivering the **On-Device Privacy-Preserving Transaction SMS Parser SDK**. The project is designed to meet production-grade standards, adhering to strict financial data security practices and the Indian Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023.

