|                                  Android Device                                   |
|                                                                                   |
|  +------------------+      +------------------+      +-------------------------+  |
|  |   SMS Receiver   | ---> |  Kotlin SDK Core | ---> |  Rust Parser (JNI)      |  |
|  |  (System Intent) |      | (Orchestrator)   |      |  - Ultra-fast Regex     |  |
|  +------------------+      +--------+---------+      |  - Deterministic FSM    |  |
|                                     |                +-------------------------+  |
|                                     v                             |               |
|                            +------------------+                   |               |
|                            |  TFLite Engine   | <-----------------+               |
|                            |  - Intent Class. |                                   |
|                            +--------+---------+                                   |
|                                     |                                             |
|                                     v                                             |
|                            +------------------+                                   |
|                            |  SQLCipher DB    |                                   |
|                            |  (Local Storage) |                                   |
|                            +--------+---------+                                   |
|                                     |                                             |
+-------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------+
                                      | (Aggregated Features Only)
                                      | Secure HTTPS / TLS 1.3
                                      v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                Node.js Cloud                                      |
|                                                                                   |
|  +------------------+      +------------------+      +-------------------------+  |
|  |  API Gateway     | ---> |  Ingestion API   | ---> | PostgreSQL              |  |
|  |  (mTLS/Auth)     |      |  (Node.js Core)  |      | (Transactional Database)|  |
|  +------------------+      +--------+---------+      +-------------------------+  |
|                                     |                                             |
|                                     v                                             |
|                            +------------------+                                   |
|                            |  Billing/License |                                   |
|                            |  Engine ($0.15)  |                                   |
|                            +------------------+                                   |
