        // ... execute assertions ...
    }
}
```

### 6.3 Rust Memory Safety & Fuzzing
* **Memory Leak Checks**: Run `valgrind` or `cargo-valgrind` on JNI-targeted test binaries to ensure zero memory leaks across FFI boundaries.
* **Fuzz Testing**: Implement `cargo-fuzz` to test the SMS parser against randomly mutated strings to guarantee that arbitrary inputs do not cause panic or memory exhaustion.

```rust
// Fuzz Target Implementation
#![no_main]
use libfuzzer_sys::fuzz_target;
use rust_core::parser::parse_transaction;

fuzz_target!(|data: &[u8]| {
    if let Ok(s) = std::str::from_utf8(data) {
        let _ = parse_transaction(s);
    }
});
```

